<title>UK: Avtobank sets $25 million June 1997 FRN.</title>
<headline>Avtobank sets $25 million June 1997 FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by joint lead managers HSBC Markets and Narodny Bank Limited.</p>
<p> BORROWER   AVTOBANK (A BANK INCORPORATED IN RUSSIA)</p>
<p> AMT    $25 MLN	 BASE	 6M-LIBOR  MATURITY    09.JUN.97</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +550 BP   PAY DATE    19.DEC.96</p>
<p> DENOMS (K) 50	  ISS PRICE  99.75     FULL FEES   UNDISC</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
